2. Library Membership Tracker
○ Create a class Member with attributes like name, ID, membership date. Add
methods to check membership validity.

soln-
Start
Class Member:
Attribute name
Attribute memberId
Attribute membershipDate
Attribute validTillDate

Constructor(name, memberId, membershipDate, validTillDate):
Set this.name = name
Set this.memberId = memberId
Set this.membershipDate = membershipDate
Set this.validTillDate = validTillDate

Method checkValidity(currentDate):
If currentDate <= validTillDate
Print Membership Active
Else
Print Membership Expired

Main:
Create Member(Alice, 101, 01-01-2024, 31-12-2024)
Call checkValidity(20-08-2025)
End

