1. Undo Feature in Text Editor
○ Use a Stack to store undo operations and implement revert functionality.

soln-
Start
Class TextEditor:
Attribute text      
Attribute history   

Method write(newText)
Push current text into history
text = text + newText

Method undo()
If history is not empty
text = Pop from history
Else
text = ""

Method showText()
Print text

Main
Create object editor of TextEditor
editor.write("Hello ")
editor.write("World")
editor.showText()  
editor.undo()
editor.showText()  
End
